  <developer_name>dixonSolutions</developer_name>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/dixonSolutions/SuperTuxKart-Touch</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/dixonSolutions/SuperTuxKart-Touch/issues</url>
  <description>
    <p>
      SuperTuxKart Touch is a tablet-first build of SuperTuxKart with a glass
      virtual stick, drift / item / nitro buttons, touch settings, and an
      in-game screen keyboard. Defaults favour thermal headroom on fanless
      devices (30 FPS, reduced RTTs, lights/shadows off).
    </p>
    <p>
      The Flatpak ships the touch engine and UI. Race assets (tracks and karts)
      are reused from a system Flathub SuperTuxKart install when available,
      keeping this package slim.
    </p>
  </description>
